WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.758
The paper makes three contributions.

00:00:03.838 --> 00:00:07.596
First, USIS10K,

00:00:07.676 --> 00:00:11.433
the first large-scale underwater salient instance
segmentation dataset,

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:15.271
with 10,632 pixel-level annotated images across
seven categories.

00:00:15.351 --> 00:00:19.109
Second, USIS-SAM,

00:00:19.189 --> 00:00:22.947
an architecture built on SAM featuring an
Underwater Adaptive Visual Transformer encoder

00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:26.784
and an out-of-the-box Salient Feature Prompt
Generator that removes manual prompts.

00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:30.622
Third, extensive experiments show it beats
state-of-the-art methods,

00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:34.460
with data and code released.
